BaoStock 0.9.4 — license evidence
=================================

The upstream wheel `baostock-0.9.4-py3-none-any.whl` ships **no LICENSE file** (verified by
unpacking it: `LICENSE`, `COPYING` and `NOTICE` are absent). Redistribution here rests on the
license declaration carried by the same wheel's package metadata (`baostock-0.9.4.dist-info/METADATA`),
quoted verbatim below:

    Name: baostock
    Version: 0.9.4
    Summary: A tool for obtaining historical data of China stock market
    Home-page: http://www.baostock.com
    Author: baostock
    Author-email: baostock@163.com
    License: BSD License
    Classifier: License :: OSI Approved :: BSD License

The package is redistributed unmodified for use with the plugin's private Python runtime.
See `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` at the repository root for the package inventory and usage.
